# DEMO G9 - Juegos A: Tetris Coop, Poker, RefillGame
# Menu Juegos: 6 opciones (0..5) en bandas iguales de ~171 cuentas:
#   Tetris 0..170, Poker 171..341, Refill 342..511, Choose4Me 512..682,
#   HippoRadar 683..853, 3 en raya 854..1023.
wait 400
# --- Tetris Coop (icono 0) ---
pot 1000
wait 300
tap morse
wait 300
pot 0
wait 350
expect text Tetris
shot g9_tetris_01_menu
in 0 morse down
in 120 morse up
run 900
shot g9_tetris_02_juego
in 0 finish down
in 120 finish up
run 1500
# --- Poker (icono 1) ---
pot 1000
wait 300
tap morse
wait 300
pot 256
wait 350
expect text Poker
shot g9_poker_01_menu
in 0 morse down
in 120 morse up
run 900
shot g9_poker_02_juego
in 0 finish down
in 120 finish up
run 1500
# --- RefillGame (icono 2) ---
pot 1000
wait 300
tap morse
wait 300
pot 427
wait 350
expect text RefillGame
shot g9_refill_01_menu
in 0 morse down
in 120 morse up
run 900
shot g9_refill_02_juego
in 0 finish down
in 120 finish up
run 1500
print G9 Juegos A: Tetris, Poker, Refill (entrada + pantalla inicial)
